---
title: A native .tmd document
subtitle: The Taliesin-native source extension
---

This document is authored in `.tmd`, Taliesin's native **and only** source
extension. The extension governs *recognition* (which files the site walker,
the `check` walker, and link rewriting pick up); a `.qmd` file is no longer
recognized as a source document at all.

## A code block

```python
def greet(name: str) -> str:
    return f"Hello from a .tmd file, {name}!"
```

## A callout

::: {.callout-note}
`.qmd` is no longer accepted: a link to `page.html` only resolves if `page.tmd`
exists, and a stray `page.qmd` on disk is invisible to the walker, `check`, and
link rewriting alike.
:::
